# 统一行尾，避免 Windows 上提交的 CRLF 导致 Linux 容器里脚本报
# "unexpected word (expecting do)" 之类的问题
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf

# Dockerfile 无扩展名，单独指定
Dockerfile* text eol=lf

*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gz    binary
